# Optional provider-native environment inherited by Codex/Claude/Qoder subprocesses.
#
# Keep this file minimal. Prefer each provider's native configuration and
# authentication files. v0.12 proxy routing does NOT come from this file:
# configure SERVERFS_PROXY_* plus SERVERFS_AGENT_USE_PROXY / SERVERFS_JEV_USE_PROXY
# in the repository .env instead. The Bridge deletes ambient proxy variables before
# constructing provider SDKs so direct/proxied behavior is explicit and auditable.
#
# Install as:
#   ~/.config/serverfs-agent-bridge/provider.env
# owned by the current user, mode 0600.
#
# Examples:
# PATH=/home/<bridge-user>/.local/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://provider-native-endpoint.example
